# Q26 Which questions about "who is the customer on this order?" must resolve to one role? (a transaction association names the role; the agent must refuse an answer without one)
PREFIX party: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/party/>
PREFIX con: <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/consumer/>
PREFIX skos: <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
SELECT ?association ?rule WHERE {
  party:participatesIn rdfs:domain party:PartyRole ; rdfs:range party:PartyTransactionAssociation .
  party:PartyTransactionAssociation skos:definition ?association .
  <https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/consumer/rule/no-customer-without-role> con:reliesOn party:roleType ; skos:definition ?rule .
}
